Specifications followed
-----------------------

HyperFrames (HTML rendered to video)
  Apache License 2.0. Motion Studio follows its timing contract: timing
  attributes, [start, end) visibility windows, determinism rules, tracks and
  safe zones (ADR 0010). No HyperFrames code is copied or bundled; Diazo's own
  runtime implements the contract with WAAPI and CSS.

EffectCraft (motion effects)
  MIT License OR Apache License 2.0 (dual licensed, at your option).
  Copyright the EffectCraft contributors.
  The GLSL effect bodies in src/lib/motion/gl.ts implement the standard image
  algorithms (blur taps, luminance ops, hash noise, distance fields) the same
  way EffectCraft's effect modules do, in the spirit of that project — the
  names, parameter shapes and effect families informed our registry. No
  EffectCraft code is copied or bundled; every shader is an original
  implementation, and the registry uses Diazo's own effect ids.
